WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.673
FORMER DC OFFICER MICHAEL FANONE REVEALING TAPES HE
SECRETLY RECORDED.

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:09.742
SAYING AS I ENTERED THE CAPITOL,
I DID WHAT I ALWAYS DID WHEN I

00:00:09.742 --> 00:00:15.381
WENT ON A RISKY OP, I HIT THE
RECORD BUTTON ON MY iPHONE AND

00:00:15.381 --> 00:00:19.552
STUFFED IT IN MY POCKET.
HE WAS ONE OF THE OFFICERS

00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:23.723
ATTACKED BY ONE OF TRUMP
SUPPORTERS, HE WAS SEVERELY

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:27.393
BEATEN, SUFFERED A HEART ATTACK
AS WELL AS A TRAUMATIC BRAIN

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:30.196
INJURY.
FIRST LET'S GET TO CNN'S WHITNEY

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.198
WILD JOINING US WITH THIS NEW
AUDIO.

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:35.335
TELL US ABOUT THIS.
&gt;&gt; WE KNEW THESE MEETINGS WERE

00:00:35.335 --> 00:00:38.438
HAPPENING.
THERE WAS VIDEO OF HARRY DUNN,

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:47.480
MICHAEL FANONE AS WELL AS
SICKNICK ON THE CAPITOL THAT

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:53.419
DAY.
IN THEIR OWN WORDS MICHAEL

00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:58.925
FANONE BRINGING US THOSE
LAWMAKERS.

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:02.562
A SECRETLY RECORDED MEETING WITH
HOUSE MINORITY LEADER KEVIN

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:06.266
McCARTHY SHOWS THE LENGTHS TWO
OFFICERS PROTECTING THE CAPITOL

00:01:06.266 --> 00:01:10.336
FALSEHOODS ABOUT THE ATTACK.
&gt;&gt; WHAT I FOUND MOST DISTRESSING

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:14.908
IS THE COMMENTS MADE BY,
UNFORTUNATELY AS A LIFELONG

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:20.146
REPUBLICAN MYSELF, COMING FROM
REPUBLICAN LAWMAKERS,

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:25.251
SPECIFICALLY PEOPLE LIKE ANDREW
CLYDE WHO MADE STATEMENTS ABOUT

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:29.956
JANUARY 6th WHICH WERE -- NOT
JUST SHOCKING, BUT DISGRACEFUL.

00:01:29.956 --> 00:01:37.030
REFERRING TO JANUARY 6th AS A
REGULAR TOUR DAY AT THE CAPITOL.

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:41.401
WHAT I SEE HAPPENING HERE IS I
SEE LAWMAKERS WHO DON'T BELIEVE

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:44.237
THAT JANUARY 6th IS POLITICALLY
ADVANTAGEOUS TO THEM.

00:01:44.237 --> 00:01:46.639
NOBODY BUYS IT.
IT'S CRAP.

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:54.080
IT'S CRAP.
IT'S DISGRACEFUL.

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.648
&gt;&gt; --
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THE MEETING WAS

00:01:55.648 --> 00:02:00.420
LEGALLY RECORDED IN JUNE 2021 BY
D.C. METROPOLITAN POLICE OFFICER

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:03.356
MICHAEL FANONE.
FANONE CALLS ON McCARTHY TO

00:02:03.356 --> 00:02:07.293
DENOUNCE THE 21 REPUBLICAN
MEMBERS WHO VOTED AGAINST

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:10.964
GRANTING CONGRESSIONAL GOLD
MEDALS TO THOSE WHO DEFENDED THE

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:13.099
CAPITOL.
&gt;&gt; WHAT I'VE EXPERIENCED SINCE

00:02:13.099 --> 00:02:17.437
THEN HAS BEEN HORRIFIC.
IT'S HELL ON EARTH.

00:02:17.437 --> 00:02:20.940
I'M NOT A POLITICAL PERSON.
I DO NOT ENJOY MY TIME HERE ON

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:23.309
CAPITOL HILL.
I WOULD MUCH RAEGTER BE SITTING

00:02:23.309 --> 00:02:29.816
AT HOME WITH MY DAUGHTERS
DRINKING A COLD BEER, BUT

00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:37.523
INSTEAD I FEEL AN EXTENSION OF
MY SERVICE ON JANUARY 6th TO BE

00:02:37.523 --> 00:02:40.493
UP HERE RIGHTING THIS WRONG.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THE MEETING WAS

00:02:40.493 --> 00:02:49.669
ALSO ATTENDED BY POLICE OFFICER
HARRY DUNN AND GLADYS SICKNICK.

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:54.707
McCARTHY TELLS HIM HE WANTS TO
SEE JUSTICE SERVED.

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:57.977
FANONE URGES HIM TO TAKE THE
CAPITOL ATTACK SERIOUSLY.

00:02:57.977 --> 00:03:03.349
&gt;&gt; I'M ASKING YOU TO AGREE TO
TAKING THE SPECIAL COMMITTEE

00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:06.619
SERIOUSLY, APPOINTING SERIOUS
PEOPLE TO THAT COMMITTEE WHO

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:13.293
WILL NOT BE OBSTRUCTIONISTS AND
WHO WILL ALLOW THE INVESTIGATION

00:03:13.293 --> 00:03:15.995
TO BE DONE.
IN LAW ENFORCEMENT -- WHEN WE

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:20.033
GET INVOLVED IN AN INVESTIGATION
THAT WE DON'T CARE ABOUT, WE

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:29.709
ASSIGN THE BIGGEST HUMPS TO
PARTI

00:03:29.709 --> 00:03:31.477
PARTICIPATE.
&gt;&gt; YOU'RE AN INTELLIGENT MAN.

00:03:31.477 --> 00:03:35.615
YOU KNOW WHAT I'M TALKING ABOUT.
&gt;&gt; McCARTHY APPOINTED FIVE

00:03:35.615 --> 00:03:39.118
REPUBLICANS TO THE COMMITTEE.
HOUSE SPEAKER NANCY PELOSI

00:03:39.118 --> 00:03:41.988
REJECTED TWO BECAUSE THEY
OBJECTED TO THE CERTIFICATION OF

00:03:41.988 --> 00:03:44.991
THE 2020 ELECTION.
McCARTHY PULLED THE OTHER THREE.

00:03:44.991 --> 00:03:49.462
DAYS AFTER THE MEETING McCARTHY
SAID THIS --

00:03:49.462 --> 00:03:53.366
&gt;&gt; IT WOULD BE SHOCKING TO ME
FOR ANYBODY, FROM A PARTY ON THE

00:03:53.366 --> 00:03:58.104
OTHER SIDE TO COME AND WANT TO
ACCEPT A POSITION, DEMOCRAT FOR

00:03:58.104 --> 00:04:01.774
ME AND IT WOULD BE SHOCKING FOR
ME TO HAVE A REPUBLICAN GO TO A

00:04:01.774 --> 00:04:05.511
SPEAKER PELOSI OF ALL PEOPLE TO
ACCEPT A COMMITTEE ASSIGNMENT.

00:04:05.511 --> 00:04:09.716
&gt;&gt; Reporter: IN THE RECORDING
FANONE REMINDS McCARTHY HOW

00:04:09.716 --> 00:04:13.319
DANGEROUS THE DAY WAS FOR
McCARTHY AND HIS STAFF.

00:04:13.319 --> 00:04:16.522
HE ALSO BRINGS UP THE PHONE CALL
McCARTHY HAD WITH THEN PRESIDENT

00:04:16.522 --> 00:04:21.728
TRUMP URGING HIM TO ACT, A CALL
THAT OTHER REPUBLICAN LAWMAKERS

00:04:21.728 --> 00:04:24.597
SAY DEE VOL FED INTO A SHOUTING
MATCH.

00:04:24.597 --> 00:04:26.699
&gt;&gt; THE PRESIDENT'S STATEMENTS
THAT DAY WERE BS.

00:04:26.699 --> 00:04:28.401
YOU KNOW.
YOU WERE ON THE PHONE WITH HIM.

00:04:28.401 --> 00:04:33.005
WHILE YOU WERE ON THE PHONE WITH
HIM, I WAS GETTING THE SHIT

00:04:33.005 --> 00:04:36.409
KICKED OUT OF ME, ALMOST LOSING
MY LIFE.

00:04:36.409 --> 00:04:42.348
THE WAY THAT HE -- THIS IS WHAT
HAPPENS WHEN YOU STEAL AN

00:04:42.348 --> 00:04:43.616
ELECTION.
GO HOME.

00:04:43.616 --> 00:04:48.654
I LOVE YOU.
WHAT THE [ BLEEP ] IS THAT?

00:04:48.654 --> 00:04:53.326
THAT CAME FROM THE PRESIDENT OF
THE UNITED STATES!

00:04:53.326 --> 00:04:56.396
&gt;&gt; Reporter: McCARTHY DEFENDED
TRUMP AT VARIOUS POINTS IN THE

00:04:56.396 --> 00:04:59.399
MOMENT.
&gt;&gt; HE WASN'T WATCHING TV --

00:04:59.399 --> 00:05:04.170
&gt;&gt; HE KNEW WHAT WAS GOING ON.
THEY WERE FIGHTING FOR HOURS AND

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:12.745
HOURS AND HOURS.
IT DOESN'T MAKE ANY SENSE TO ME.

00:05:12.745 --> 00:05:19.619
&gt;&gt; I'M JUST TELLING YOU FROM MY
PHONE CALL, I DON'T KNOW THAT HE

00:05:19.619 --> 00:05:21.554
DID KNOW THAT.
&gt;&gt; SIGNIFICANT MOMENT THERE.

00:05:21.554 --> 00:05:25.425
BRIANNA, IT'S ONE THING -- YOU
SEE MIKE FANONE ON OUR AIR A

00:05:25.425 --> 00:05:27.560
LOT.
IT'S ONE THING FOR SOMEONE TO

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.829
COME OUT PUBLICLY AND VOICE
THEIR OPINIONS.

00:05:29.829 --> 00:05:34.367
WHAT FANONE DID WAS HE TOLD
THOSE PEOPLE IN THIS PRIVATE

00:05:34.367 --> 00:05:36.836
MEETING TO THEIR FACE HOW HE
REALLY FELT.

00:05:36.836 --> 00:05:41.407
HE HAD THE NERVE TO DO THAT
WHICH YOU DON'T ALWAYS SEE

00:05:41.407 --> 00:05:43.109
PEOPLE DO.
HE TOOK THEM TO TASK.

00:05:43.109 --> 00:05:48.481
WHAT HE'S TRYING TO DO OVER THE
LAST 18 MONTHS OR SO IS SHOW

00:05:48.481 --> 00:05:51.417
WHERE PEOPLE ARE FLIP-FLOPPING
ON A REALLY IMPORTANT ISSUE AND

00:05:51.417 --> 00:05:54.587
MAKING IT A CORE VALUE FOR HIM
TO CALL PEOPLE OUT WHEN THEIR

00:05:54.587 --> 00:05:57.490
NARRATIVE IS CHANGING AND HOLD
THEM ACCOUNTABLE.

00:05:57.490 --> 00:06:01.194
&gt;&gt; TRYING TO RIGHT A WRONG AS HE
SAID IN HIS DISCUSSION WITH

00:06:01.194 --> 00:06:03.696
KEVIN McCARTHY.
WHITNEY, THANK YOU FOR TAKING US

00:06:03.696 --> 00:06:06.666
THROUGH THAT.
&gt;&gt;&gt; JOINING US NOW IS THE AUTHOR

00:06:06.666 --> 00:06:10.536
OF "HOLD THE LINE, THE
INSURRECTION AND ONE COP'S

00:06:10.536 --> 00:06:15.374
BATTLE FOR AMERICA'S SOUL" WHICH
IS OUT TOMORROW.

00:06:15.374 --> 00:06:18.544
CNN LAW ENFORCEMENT ANALYST
MICHAEL FANONE.

00:06:18.544 --> 00:06:22.081
MIKE DEFENDED THE CAPITOL DURING
THE JANUARY 6th ATTACK AND PAID

00:06:22.081 --> 00:06:25.251
A HUGE PERSONAL PRICE FOR DOING
SO.

00:06:25.251 --> 00:06:27.453
MIKE, THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR
BEING WITH US TODAY.

00:06:27.453 --> 00:06:30.022
WE'RE LISTENING TO THESE
RECORDINGS.

00:06:30.022 --> 00:06:33.960
YOU SOUND A LOT ON THEM LIKE YOU
DO JUST ON TV OR IN PERSON.

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:36.062
IT'S CERTAINLY THE SAME THING,
THE SAME GUY.

00:06:36.062 --> 00:06:40.399
WHAT DID YOU MAKE OF THE
RESPONSE THAT YOU GOT FROM KEVIN

00:06:40.399 --> 00:06:48.774
McCARTHY IN THAT MEETING?
&gt;&gt; IT WASN'T SURPRISING TO ME.

00:06:48.774 --> 00:06:55.381
I SAW HOW HE HAD DEVIATED FROM
HIS ORIGINAL STATEMENTS

00:06:55.381 --> 00:06:58.150
IMMEDIATELY AFTER JANUARY 6th,
TO SEIZE UPON THE POLITICS OF

00:06:58.150 --> 00:07:02.054
THE MOMENT.
IT'S IRONIC IN THAT HE WAS -- HE

00:07:02.054 --> 00:07:06.526
WANTED TO ENSURE THAT JANUARY
6th WAS NOT POLITICIZED, BUT IN

00:07:06.526 --> 00:07:13.599
A WAY HE'S POLITICIZED JANUARY
6th THE MOST.

00:07:13.599 --> 00:07:17.102
IT JUST WASN'T SURPRISING.
BUT I'M GLAD I RECORDED IT.

00:07:17.102 --> 00:07:21.507
THAT'S WHY I RECORDED IT, WAS
BECAUSE I DIDN'T EXPECT KEVIN

00:07:21.507 --> 00:07:27.613
McCARTHY TO, NUMBER ONE, TELL
THE TRUTH; NUMBER TWO, RECOUNT

00:07:27.613 --> 00:07:32.785
THE CONVERSATION ACCURATELY, AND
NUMBER THREE I WANTED TO SHOW

00:07:32.785 --> 00:07:35.688
PEOPLE HOW INDIFFERENT LAWMAKERS
ARE, NOT JUST REPUBLICAN

00:07:35.688 --> 00:07:40.493
LAWMAKERS, BUT ALL LAWMAKERS TO
THE ACTUAL AMERICAN PEOPLE THAT

00:07:40.493 --> 00:07:45.264
THEY ARE REPRESENTING.
&gt;&gt; IN THAT CONVERSATION, ONE OF

00:07:45.264 --> 00:07:48.668
THE THINGS THAT YOU TELL
McCARTHY IS THAT SOME OF THE

00:07:48.668 --> 00:07:52.638
PEOPLE THAT YOU AND YOUR MOTHER
KNOW WHO DON'T THINK THAT WHAT

00:07:52.638 --> 00:07:57.543
YOU EXPERIENCED HAPPENED HAVE
SAID THAT FOOTAGE FROM YOUR

00:07:57.543 --> 00:08:01.113
BODY-WORN CAMERA, WHICH IS
HORRIFIC FOR ANYONE WHO HASN'T

00:08:01.113 --> 00:08:02.481
SEEN IT.
IT IS HORRIFIC.

00:08:02.481 --> 00:08:06.018
THEY THINK IT'S FAKED.
WHAT DO THEY THINK?

00:08:06.018 --> 00:08:16.495
DO THEY THINK YOU'RE PART OF
SOME CONSPIRACY?

00:08:16.495 --> 00:08:21.000
&gt;&gt; UNFORTUNATELY, RHETORIC FROM
THESE POLITICIANS COMBINED WITH

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:26.906
SOME OF THE ALT RIGHT OR RIGHT
WING PROPAGANDA, PEOPLE BELIEVE

00:08:26.906 --> 00:08:31.844
THAT STUFF.
THERE HAVE BEEN A WHOLE SLEW OF

00:08:31.844 --> 00:08:34.146
CONSPIRACIES THAT HAVE KIND OF
POPPED UP ABOUT ME.

00:08:34.146 --> 00:08:38.985
THE HARDEST THING TO ACCEPT IS
PEOPLE THAT HAVE KNOWN ME FOR IN

00:08:38.985 --> 00:08:44.890
SOME CASES DECADES BUYING INTO A
LOT OF THAT CRAP, THE IDEA THAT

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:50.630
I WORK FOR THE FBI AND I'VE BEEN
A PLANT IN THE METROPOLITAN

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:54.700
POLICE DEPARTMENT FOR TWO
DECADES WAITING FOR THIS MOMENT,

00:08:54.700 --> 00:09:01.207
OR THAT I WAS SOMEHOW SPAWNED
FROM A PETRI DISH AND AM THE

00:09:01.207 --> 00:09:06.979
LOVE CHILD OF NANCY PELOSI AND
GOD KNOWS WHO ELSE AND ACTUALLY

00:09:06.979 --> 00:09:10.349
BELIEVE IT.
&gt;&gt; YOU VOTED FOR TRUMP IN 2016,

00:09:10.349 --> 00:09:14.487
RIGHT?
&gt;&gt; YES, MA'AM, I DID.

00:09:14.487 --> 00:09:17.623
&gt;&gt; OBVIOUSLY THIS IS SOMEONE WHO
AT ONE POINT YOU SUPPORTED.

00:09:17.623 --> 00:09:20.626
CERTAINLY YOU DON'T ANYMORE, AND
I KNOW YOU HAD SOME ISSUES WITH

00:09:20.626 --> 00:09:26.899
HIM EVEN PRIOR TO JANUARY 6th.
WHAT WAS IT LIKE FOR YOU, NOT

00:09:26.899 --> 00:09:31.737
JUST FROM THE GENERAL PUBLIC,
BUT FROM FELLOW POLICE OFFICERS

00:09:31.737 --> 00:09:37.710
INCLUDING ONES THAT YOU HAD
KNOWN FOR SO LONG AFTER JANUARY

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:44.850
6th, AFTER TESTIFYING?
&gt;&gt; THE CRITICISM THAT CAME FROM

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:47.086
THE LAW ENFORCEMENT COMMUNITY
HIT ME THE HARDEST.

00:09:47.086 --> 00:09:51.657
IF YOU READ THROUGH THE BOOK, I
TALK ABOUT SOME CRITICISM THAT I

00:09:51.657 --> 00:09:58.531
GOT PRETTY EARLY ON AFTER ONE OF
MY FIRST INTERVIEWS FROM A

00:09:58.531 --> 00:10:09.575
DETECTIVE NAMED YARI BABICH WHO
ACCUSED ME OF BEING AN ATTENTION

00:10:09.575 --> 00:10:13.012
SEEKER AND FELT THIS WAS ONLY
DONE IN MY OWN SELF-INTEREST.

00:10:13.012 --> 00:10:17.750
I WOULDN'T WISH THIS EXPERIENCE
ON MY WORST ENEMY.

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:21.887
FOR PEOPLE THAT KNOW ME, THERE'S
NOT MUCH I WOULDN'T WISH ON SOME

00:10:21.887 --> 00:10:27.226
OF MY WORST ENEMIES.
IT'S A DIFFICULT EXPERIENCE TO

00:10:27.226 --> 00:10:31.197
NAVIGATE, PUTTING YOURSELF OUT
THERE, SUBJECTING YOURSELF TO

00:10:31.197 --> 00:10:35.367
CRITICISM FROM NOT ONLY THOSE IN
YOUR IMMEDIATE CIRCLE, BUT

00:10:35.367 --> 00:10:38.404
REALLY FROM EVERYONE IN THE
WORLD.

00:10:38.404 --> 00:10:43.242
THAT'S BEEN THE HARDEST PART
ABOUT THE PROCESS IN PREPARING

00:10:43.242 --> 00:10:48.314
THIS BOOK, IS KNOWING THAT I'M
NOW SUBJECTING MYSELF, MY CAREER

00:10:48.314 --> 00:10:53.886
IN LAW ENFORCEMENT AND MY
ACTIVITIES SINCE JANUARY 6th TO

00:10:53.886 --> 00:10:59.091
CRITIQUE BY ANYONE AND EVERYONE.

